{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still in development, any feedback is very much appreciated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the role of an investigative journalist in Harlem, in the early 1940s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Someone has been murdered, and the explanations that the police has come up with just don't add up. Furthermore, the person that the police are accusing of the murder is a good friend of yours, so you'll do anything you can to find out the truth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take Pictures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your camera to collect evidence; take pictures of anything that seems important to the case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/picture.png?t=1749226994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Organize Evidence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See the evidence you collected in your journal, where you can organize and look at the pictures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/journal.png?t=1749226994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather Clues</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to people to try and find out what they know. But be careful, some might try to lie to you, and hide the truth. Get their testimonies and piece together the real story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/talk-ronald.png?t=1749226994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve the Case</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your case in the article and publish it to expose the true killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/extras/publishboard.png?t=1749226994\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Who Framed Me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365840/8660aec09cc17fd294ac1e9b25832b59441d529c.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta Frame Them All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365840/8e00185f744f8e1adf488ff691cf85fdd2a1ad6b.jpg"},{"name":"The Rainman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365840/d0b7e47d48d620e8bd376ee06dbfe43b0c294a51.jpg"},{"name":"The Cake","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365840/0297ac7a977331a8e298a1254f603cbf0707d9a6.jpg"},{"name":"The Reporter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3365840/eddb9b5f340b82f915ed66a15ca27ca3cf1a1cf9.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365840?t=1749226994","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365840?t=1749226994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/0bb9bcca9f38bbb1279fc897ea4e9b5093191068/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749226994","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365840/0bb9bcca9f38bbb1279fc897ea4e9b5093191068/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749226994","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of the aftermath of violent crimes. The game consists of solving those crimes, and finding the culprit, cause of death, motive etc.\r\n\r\nThis content is part of the main story and is unavoidable."},"demos":[{"appid":3617780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In Development</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still in development, any feedback is very much appreciated!</p><p cla